{"url": "https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Dad/status/2114217410823688573", "id": "2114217410823688573", "text": "Everyone said \"Hey Grok\" was impossible on iPhone. Even Grok said Apple keeps wake words for Siri only. So I kept digging, and I found a way. Now I just say \"Hey Grok\" and Grok Bot voice chat opens. No extra apps, no cost, all built into iOS.\n\nHow to set it up:\n\n1. Make sure your Grok Bot app is up to date\n\n2. Shortcuts app \u2192 + \u2192 Add Action \u2192 search \"Grok Bot\" \u2192 pick \"Start Voice Chat with Bot\"\n\n3. Settings \u2192 Accessibility \u2192 Vocal Shortcuts \u2192 Set Up \u2192 pick that shortcut \u2192 type \"Hey Grok\" and say it 3 times\n\n4. In the shortcut's details, turn on \"Allow Running When Locked\"\n\nIf your phone is locked, iOS asks for one tap first. If Face ID already unlocked it, it's fully hands-free.", "raw_text": {"text": "Everyone said \"Hey Grok\" was impossible on iPhone. Even Grok said Apple keeps wake words for Siri only. So I kept digging, and I found a way. Now I just say \"Hey Grok\" and Grok Bot voice chat opens. No extra apps, no cost, all built into iOS.\n\nHow to set it up:\n\n1. Make sure your Grok Bot app is up to date\n\n2. Shortcuts app \u2192 + \u2192 Add Action \u2192 search \"Grok Bot\" \u2192 pick \"Start Voice Chat with Bot\"\n\n3. Settings \u2192 Accessibility \u2192 Vocal Shortcuts \u2192 Set Up \u2192 pick that shortcut \u2192 type \"Hey Grok\" and say it 3 times\n\n4. In the shortcut's details, turn on \"Allow Running When Locked\"\n\nIf your phone is locked, iOS asks for one tap first. If Face ID already unlocked it, it's fully hands-free.", "display_text_range": [0, 687], "facets": [{"type": "media", "indices": [281, 304], "id": "2114217001547620352", "display": "pic.x.com/RcjoDGcJps", "original": "https://t.co/RcjoDGcJps", "replacement": "https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Dad/status/2114217410823688573/video/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "Texas_Twins_Dad", "url": "https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Da